<title>USA: Movie Star sees 97 Q1 pre-tax gain.</title>
<headline>Movie Star sees 97 Q1 pre-tax gain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Movie Star Inc said on Tuesday it expects a pre-tax gain of $500,000 for the first quarter ended September 30, 1996 after the company had repurchased some of its debentures.</p>
<p>The company had purchased $1.32 million of principal of the 12.875 percent subordinated debentures at a price of $565.00 per $1,000 face amount of each debenture, Movie Star said.</p>
</text>
